# Base Framework

Framework tái sử dụng cho Unity game. Gồm 4 module: **DI, StateMachine, EventBus, Value**.

---

## 1. Cài đặt package

Mở `Packages/manifest.json`, thêm vào phần `dependencies`:

```json
"com.unity.addressables": "2.8.1",
"com.cysharp.unitask": "https://github.com/Cysharp/UniTask.git?path=src/UniTask/Assets/Plugins/UniTask",
"jp.hadashikick.vcontainer": "https://github.com/hadashiA/VContainer.git?path=VContainer/Assets/VContainer#1.17.0"
```

> File `manifest_temp.txt` trong folder này chứa sẵn 3 dòng trên để copy nhanh.

---

## 2. Setup scene

### Boot scene — GameCtrl

```csharp
public class GameCtrl : GameCtrlBase<GameCtrl.State>
{
    public enum State { Boot, Home, Gameplay }
    protected override State InitialState => State.Boot;

    protected override void ConfigureStates(StateMachineBuilder<State> builder)
    {
        builder.Register<BootState>(State.Boot);
        builder.Register<HomeState>(State.Home);
        builder.Register<GameplayFlowState>(State.Gameplay);
    }

    protected override void ConfigureDependencies(IContainerBuilder builder)
    {
        builder.Register<BootState>(Lifetime.Singleton);
        builder.Register<HomeState>(Lifetime.Singleton);
        builder.Register<GameplayFlowState>(Lifetime.Singleton);
        // GameBus tự đăng ký — không cần thêm
    }
}
```

### Gameplay scene — GameplayCtrl

```csharp
public class GameplayCtrl : SceneCtrlBase<GameplayCtrl.State>
{
    public enum State { Playing, Win, Lose }
    protected override State InitialState => State.Playing;

    protected override void ConfigureStates(StateMachineBuilder<State> builder)
    {
        builder.Register<PlayingState>(State.Playing);
        builder.Register<WinState>(State.Win);
        builder.Register<LoseState>(State.Lose);
    }

    protected override void ConfigureDependencies(IContainerBuilder builder)
    {
        builder.Register<PlayingState>(Lifetime.Singleton);
        builder.Register<WinState>(Lifetime.Singleton);
        builder.Register<LoseState>(Lifetime.Singleton);
        builder.RegisterComponentInHierarchy<Player>();
        // SceneBus tự đăng ký — không cần thêm
    }
}
```

### Unity Inspector

Trong GameObject của GameplayCtrl, set **Parent** trỏ về GameCtrl
→ Scene scope resolve được dependency từ Game scope.

---

## 3. Viết State

```csharp
public class PlayingState : StateBase
{
    [Inject] private Player _player;
    [Inject] private GameplayCtrl _ctrl;
    [Inject] private SceneBus _bus;

    public override void OnEnter(object data = null)
    {
        _player.gameObject.SetActive(true);
        _bus.On<PlayerFellMessage>(OnPlayerFell);
    }

    public override void OnExit()
    {
        _bus.Off<PlayerFellMessage>(OnPlayerFell);
    }

    void OnPlayerFell(PlayerFellMessage _)
        => _ctrl.ChangeState(GameplayCtrl.State.Lose);
}
```

---

## 4. Gửi/nhận event qua Bus

```csharp
// Định nghĩa message — luôn là struct
public struct PlayerFellMessage { }
public struct EnemyDiedMessage { public int EnemyId; }

// Gửi
[Inject] private SceneBus _bus;
_bus.Send(new PlayerFellMessage());

// Nhận — On trong OnEnter, Off trong OnExit
_bus.On<PlayerFellMessage>(OnPlayerFell);
_bus.Off<PlayerFellMessage>(OnPlayerFell);
```

| Bus | Dùng khi | Tự đăng ký bởi |
|---|---|---|
| `GameBus` | Event xuyên scene | `GameCtrlBase` |
| `SceneBus` | Event trong 1 scene | `SceneCtrlBase` |

---

## 5. Bind giá trị xuống UI qua Value\<T\>

```csharp
// Model/Service
public class ScoreService
{
    public Value<int> JumpCount { get; } = new(0);
    public void AddJump() => JumpCount.Current++;
}

// View
public class ScoreUI : MonoBehaviour
{
    [Inject] private ScoreService _score;

    void OnEnable()  => _score.JumpCount.On(UpdateUI);
    void OnDisable() => _score.JumpCount.Off(UpdateUI);

    void UpdateUI(int v) => _text.text = $"Jumps: {v}";
}
```

`On()` tự nhận giá trị hiện tại ngay khi đăng ký — UI đúng ngay khi bật lên.

---

## Khi nào dùng gì

| Tình huống | Dùng |
|---|---|
| Class A cần dùng class B | **DI** — inject qua `[Inject]` |
| Object có nhiều trạng thái | **StateMachine** — `StateBase`, `ChangeState()` |
| 2 hệ thống cần giao tiếp, không biết nhau | **Bus** — `Send`, `On`, `Off` |
| Giá trị thay đổi cần cập nhật UI | **Value\<T\>** — `Current`, `On`, `Off` |

---

## Modules

| Module | Folder | README |
|---|---|---|
| Dependency Injection | `Core/DI/` | [README](Scripts/Core/DI/README.md) |
| State Machine | `Core/StateMachine/` | [README](Scripts/Core/StateMachine/README.md) |
| Event Bus | `Core/EventBus/` | [README](Scripts/Core/EventBus/README.md) |
| Reactive Value | `Core/Value/` | [README](Scripts/Core/Value/README.md) |
